{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02516","headline":"七夕赋咏成篇 · 何仲宣","name":"七夕赋咏成篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日日思归勤理鬓，朝朝伫望嬾调梭。\n凌风宝扇遥临月，映水仙车远渡河。\n历历珠星疑拖佩，冉冉云衣似曳罗。\n通宵道意终无尽，向晓离愁已复多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何仲宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}